| Patch Management              | Workstations patched within 14 days       | Fail    | Device_List shows 4/15 systems with outdated patches | High     | Implement automated patch deployment and remediate outstanding vulnerabilities | IT Team | 2026-01-15 |
| User Access Control           | MFA enabled for Microsoft 365 users       | Partial | MFA enabled for admins only                          | High     | Enable MFA for all users                                                       | IT Team | __________ |
| Secure Configuration          | Local administrator accounts controlled   | Pass    | Admin account review completed                       | Low      | Continue monitoring                                                            | IT Team | N/A        |
| Firewalls & Internet Gateways | Firewall management interface restricted  | Pass    | firewall_admin_access.png                            | Low      | Maintain configuration review schedule                                         | IT Team | N/A        |
| Malware Protection            | Endpoint protection installed and updated | Partial | AV status report indicates 2 unmanaged devices       | Medium   | Enrol unmanaged devices into protection platform                               | IT Team | __________ |

